Package: healdan-helper
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: The Healdan Project
Homepage: https://docs.healdan.com
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libsecret-tools, libnotify-bin, libreoffice-core, libreoffice-script-provider-python, libharfbuzz0b, libice6, libsm6, libfontconfig1, libx11-6, libxi6, libxrandr2, libxcursor1, libxext6, libxfixes3, libicu78, libssl3t64, zlib1g, libstdc++6
Recommends: libreoffice-writer, libreoffice-calc, libreoffice-impress, libreoffice-draw
Description: Opens and saves Healdan documents in LibreOffice
 The Healdan Helper opens and saves Healdan documents in LibreOffice, and takes the links from the web page.
